          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "He came to Derbe and Lystra; and behold, a certain disciple was there, named Timothy, the son of a Jewess who believed, but his father was a Greek.",
      "ko": "바울이 더베와 루스드라에도 이르매 거기 디모데라 하는 제자가 있으니 그 모친은 믿는 유대 여자요 부친은 헬라인이라",
      "source_text_hash": "cc6a4783342d2c4eed75934fc93cf6045672e26d76e28d8c7fae00362de06d12",
      "translation_text_hash": "04ce21d71141ea3ca9f7b81629eca2a76a74699ccff8f7f593f2cc7b5d2efcde",
