      "en": "The brothers who were at Lystra and Iconium gave a good testimony about him.",
      "ko": "디모데는 루스드라와 이고니온에 있는 형제들에게 칭찬 받는 자니",
      "source_text_hash": "cc6a98ca269e29972c19b1d6ea966205eba13c98526039cdf67e57544cf35bf1",
      "translation_text_hash": "1dbd1fa4cb31ba1f5b1b723303679e0ecd2e375add8887d014322eeafabf2048",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "디모데는 루스드라와 이고니온에 있는 형제들에게 칭찬 받는 자니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1dbd1fa4cb31ba1f5b1b723303679e0ecd2e375add8887d014322eeafabf2048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ACT:16:3",
      "sequence": 27484,
