      "en": "So the assemblies were strengthened in the faith, and increased in number daily.",
      "ko": "이에 여러 교회가 믿음이 더 굳어지고 수가 날마다 더하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "fa967ef96a7e70e7aedbb155a01ff7219fb1043c7519ca3f4b8664a653f10634",
      "translation_text_hash": "152360071fc23f70ece717f48b2c9965979def6a0b4be1c3a24dbfc0fb428bce",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이에 여러 교회가 믿음이 더 굳어지고 수가 날마다 더하니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "152360071fc23f70ece717f48b2c9965979def6a0b4be1c3a24dbfc0fb428bce"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ACT:16:6",
      "sequence": 27487,
      "chapter_label": "ACT 16",
