        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Setting sail therefore from Troas, we made a straight course to Samothrace, and the day following to Neapolis;",
      "ko": "드로아에서 배로 떠나 사모드라게로 직행하여 이튿날 네압볼리로 가고",
      "source_text_hash": "8eb890f72db16cb6e8ee6213b1d461781f027e0943a47f300063d9a1761f3b13",
      "translation_text_hash": "87ec32cc22d27b23aebd79414c0071bbe5589107dd12dc88898f9deacdc8b0d4",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "드로아에서 배로 떠나 사모드라게로 직행하여 이튿날 네압볼리로 가고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "87ec32cc22d27b23aebd79414c0071bbe5589107dd12dc88898f9deacdc8b0d4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ACT:16:12",
